        "jsCode": "// TODO (written by hand): verify the ElevenLabs HMAC signature and extract the call.\n//\n// Input item: $input.first()\n//   .json.headers['elevenlabs-signature']  -> 't=<unix seconds>,v0=<hex hmac>'\n//   .binary.data.data                      -> raw body, base64 (Webhook option Raw Body)\n//   .json.body                             -> parsed JSON (use ONLY after the signature is verified)\n//\n// Steps:\n//   1. const crypto = require('crypto'); secret from $env.ELEVENLABS_POSTCALL_SECRET (500 if missing)\n//   2. header missing -> 401. Parse t and v0 (there may be several v0=, accept any).\n//   3. timestamp older than 30 minutes (or in the future by more than 30 min) -> 401 'stale_timestamp'\n//   4. rawBody = Buffer.from(item.binary.data.data, 'base64').toString('utf8')\n//   5. expected = crypto.createHmac('sha256', secret).update(`${t}.${rawBody}`).digest('hex')\n//   6. compare with crypto.timingSafeEqual on Buffers of equal length -> 401 'invalid_signature'\n//   7. if body.type !== 'post_call_transcription' -> return { valid:true, ignore:true }\n//   8. build ONE item:\n//        valid: true,\n//        conversation_id: data.conversation_id,\n//        customer_code: data.analysis?.data_collection_results?.codice_cliente?.value ?? null,\n//        duration_sec: data.metadata?.call_duration_secs ?? null,\n//        outcome: data.analysis?.call_successful ?? data.status ?? null,\n//        transcript: data.transcript.map(t => `[${t.role}] ${t.message}`).join('\\n'),\n//        metadata: { agent_id, termination_reason, summary: data.analysis?.transcript_summary,\n//                    tools: list of tool_name used in transcript, evaluation: data.analysis?.evaluation_criteria_results }\n//\nreturn [{ json: { valid: false, status: 500, error: 'not_implemented', message: 'Verify signature node not written yet' } }];"
